@base = http://localhost:7071
@token = local-user
@matchId = MATCH_ID
@etag = 1

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Unauthenticated match queue → 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/matches

### Match queue (pending, paginated)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/matches?status=pending&minScore=70&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Match detail
GET {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saved jobs awaiting a decision, newest first
GET {{base}}/api/v1/queue/saved-jobs?status=awaiting_decision&sort=createdAt&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Saved jobs sorted by title
GET {{base}}/api/v1/queue/saved-jobs?status=awaiting_decision&sort=jobTitle&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid sort → 400
GET {{base}}/api/v1/queue/saved-jobs?sort=score
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve a match
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: approve-1
If-Match: "{{etag}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve",
  "comment": "Strong platform overlap"
}

### Duplicate approve (same Idempotency-Key) → 200 replay
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: approve-1
If-Match: "{{etag}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve"
}

### Reject without overwrite after a decision → 409
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: reject-1
If-Match: "{{etag}}"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject"
}

### Stale If-Match → 412
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: stale-1
If-Match: "999"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve"
}

### Paginated decisions (newest first)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/decisions?pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter decisions by job and outcome
GET {{base}}/api/v1/decisions?jobId=job-1&decision=approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Decision history for one match (exactly one of matchId, jobId, resumeId)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/decisions/history?matchId={{matchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History without a filter → 400
GET {{base}}/api/v1/decisions/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reopen a decided match
POST {{base}}/api/v1/matches/{{matchId}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
